ve property of the Laplace transform, we obtain the system\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}sL{{x}_{1}(t)}-{x}_{1}(0)=-4L{{x}_{1}(t)}-5L{{x}_{2}(t)} \\\\ sL{{x}_{2}(t)}-{x}_{2}(0)=5L{{x}_{1}(t)}-3L{{x}_{2}(t)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich can be simplified to the following:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}s{X}_{1}(s)-1=-4{X}_{1}(s)-5{X}_{2}(s) \\\\ s{X}_{2}(s)+2=5{X}_{1}(s)-3{X}_{2}(s)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${X}_{1}(s)=L{{x}_{1}(t)}$ and ${X}_{2}(s)=L{{x}_{2}(t)}$ are the Laplace transforms of the functions ${x}_{1}(t)$ and ${x}_{2}(t),$ respectively." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-331906/field-1" "q-331906/field-2" "q-331906/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "fd7b8fc8-26d3-5551-9a46-45725bd863a6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-331906"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-331905/field-1/eaed7d3877e45dabf729495c0dc10b54cd1c460f467f0543303a2f5445d59874" :answer/id #uuid "5e0cccee-7bbf-5bf1-987b-cb92e6f4fb56" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{X}_{1}(s)+3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-331905/field-1/33559c69d95a124856fd884b6a39b466978e5e7a3aa2d2c8a58d71994abb0288" :answer/id #uuid "f9bd1379-8e08-523c-bd87-ebf0872bee5c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "s{X}_{1}(s)-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-331905/field-1/b20382d842ace3c8595b6bc7e14516923525b1b867139a78b5b3b530c53b4bb6" :answer/id #uuid "2d69bb02-a14e-5368-8d57-6d832ba6c866" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "s{X}_{1}(s)+3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-331905/field-1/42aace6deedc993ecc3259eba1a23f09fc1136a37def8d2f9ef749a6e1dd80d1" :answer/id #uuid "0cc6087f-f01a-5711-8deb-cc3eff7c3d0b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{X}_{1}(s)-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-331905/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "f53fcf41-c204-51be-83cc-b6d2277a3c15" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/cor